Data licence

The data in this repository (eco_measures_by_council_gb.csv and eco_totals_by_region_gb.csv)
is derived from DESNZ Household Energy Efficiency Statistics (headline release June 2026,
Tables 3.4, 3.5 and 4.4, published 25 June 2026).

Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
